# OpenSearch Dashboards Dev Tools requests. Run one request at a time.
# Read README.md and expected-results.md before sending requests.
# No headers or credentials belong in this file. Dev Tools uses its existing connection.

### 01 - Require version.number == 3.9.0
GET /

### 02 - Require 404. Stop if index exists or this check is unauthorized.
HEAD /retry-job-events

### 03 - Create only after prerequisite checks
PUT /retry-job-events
{
  "mappings": {
    "dynamic": "strict",
    "properties": {
      "batch_id": {
        "type": "keyword"
      },
      "job_id": {
        "type": "keyword"
      },
      "event_id": {
        "type": "keyword"
      },
      "state": {
        "type": "keyword"
      },
      "attempt": {
        "type": "integer",
        "coerce": false
      },
      "event_seq": {
        "type": "long",
        "coerce": false
      },
      "event_time": {
        "type": "date",
        "format": "strict_date_time"
      },
      "ingested_at": {
        "type": "date",
        "format": "strict_date_time"
      }
    }
  }
}

